<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>十二、竞品对标与游玩后的目标</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#B9CEF0' }}>05 产品设计 · 支撑</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 588, background: '#F7F9FC', padding: 28, gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 14, borderRadius: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>对标作品</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 14, borderRadius: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>它解决什么</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 14, borderRadius: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>本原型的位置</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Rocket League</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>实时物理作为竞技本体</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>同样以物理为核心，但改为回合制以降低操作门槛</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Overcooked</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>短局、高频失误、强社交</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>继承短局与派对属性，但改为对抗而非协作</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Slay the Spire</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>随机取舍带来的构筑深度</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>把构筑压缩成"每次三选一"，塞进短对局里</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', padding: 16, borderRadius: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                希望玩家玩完之后：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>记住</span>这一局的意外瞬间 →
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>再来一局</span>试试别的构筑 →
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>向朋友提起</span>它（派对游戏天然具备口碑传播属性）。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>毕业设计开题报告</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>14 / 19</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>


